WEBVTT

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:11.560
Miki...

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:19.280
It's been a long time, Oga.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.620
I'm surprised that we'd meet again like this.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:27.830
You'll be sure to come, Oga-kun, won't you?

00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:30.570
It's weird. You're acting like you know me...

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:33.760
Who are you, again?

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:54.420
Oga!

00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:58.630
The way you talk really pisses me off.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:03.260
Is it just you being contrary, or is 
that really who you are? Either way.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:06.230
That's the way you push away your friends.

00:01:06.230 --> 00:01:09.710
You step on people's trust 
like it was nothing!

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:12.560
Burying Punch!

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:15.310
Punch! Punch! Punch!

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.720
Punch!

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:19.200
Burying Kick!

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:27.390
I'll show you what a real special attack is.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:33.340
I'll tell you this ahead of time...

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:36.640
I can't hold back with this technique.

00:01:37.170 --> 00:01:40.390
If it hits, even you won't escape unhurt.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:43.580
So you'd better make sure to dodge it!

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:45.920
That's far enough.

00:01:46.950 --> 00:01:51.090
Oga... Next time. Next time I'll crush you.

00:01:51.530 --> 00:01:53.430
Get lost, idiot.

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:03.910
Just a little longer...

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:08.090
Everyone, the competition during the 
school festival's been decided on!

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:09.380
Oh?

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:10.140
And?

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:11.180
Right...

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:12.770
It's volleyball.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:14.860
Volleyball?

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:16.860
Volleyball...

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:19.710
Volleyball!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:05.970
<b>There Are Wounds in the Past.</b>

00:04:14.510 --> 00:04:15.560
Not bad, I suppose.

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.070
Stop foolin' around, you bastard!

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:23.160
What the hell's with the flowing locks, eh?

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:26.410
Himekawa's more like, poofy, or silky!

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.190
It's this way 'cause you assholes complained!

00:04:29.190 --> 00:04:30.010
Yeah?!

00:04:30.010 --> 00:04:31.440
Don't "yeah" me!

00:04:31.440 --> 00:04:33.690
Yer pissin' me off in all kinds o' ways!

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.330
Say that again, punk!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:40.980
No arguing!

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:42.970
Get back in your positions!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.120
'Kay...

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:45.970
Furuichi, may I have a sec?

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:46.920
What is it?

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:48.300
Whatever, get over here!

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.830
What am I doing?

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:53.890
Okay, we're going to try this again!

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:55.460
'Kay...

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:57.360
"What", you ask?

00:04:57.590 --> 00:05:00.480
Stop to think about it! This isn't right!

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:03.600
I just wanna beat the crap outta that shrimp!

00:05:04.210 --> 00:05:06.390
So why the hell am I playing volleyball?

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:09.250
It's not really strange...

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.080
If you lose the volleyball 
match, you'll be expelled.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:14.010
You idiot!

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.440
Why?

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:17.830
Open your eyes, Furuichi!

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:19.980
They're open!

00:05:19.980 --> 00:05:21.210
Or more like half closed now!

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:23.430
I wanna fight!

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.590
Who gives a crap about being expelled?!

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.170
You should!

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:28.590
Open <i>your</i> eyes!

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:30.980
No, no, no, no, no!

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:32.990
I wanna fight!

00:05:32.990 --> 00:05:34.340
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:05:34.340 --> 00:05:35.600
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:37.460
Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight! Fight!

00:05:37.460 --> 00:05:38.440
Cut the tantrum!

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:39.280
You there!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:44.720
What's that sound?

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:23.160
Hey. Was that the special 
move you were talking about?

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.400
Let me test it out for ya.

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:26.480
Oga?

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:31.210
An afterimage...

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:32.430
What is?

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.020
Come on now... If you 
fight or something now...

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.560
What's this?

00:06:39.530 --> 00:06:40.100
Put this on.

00:06:40.950 --> 00:06:43.760
It's no problem if we're sparring 
instead of fighting, yes?

00:06:44.730 --> 00:06:47.470
I've gotten bored with 
volleyball practice myself.

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:50.320
I'll show you, just as you wish...

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.760
The Secret Technique of the 
Izuma Eight Gods Style!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:58.770
It looks like Miku-kun is 
practicing in secret...

00:06:59.790 --> 00:07:01.770
You sure about leaving him alone?

00:07:02.050 --> 00:07:05.930
Yeah... I showed it to him. 
Maybe I shouldn't have...

00:07:06.690 --> 00:07:09.630
Honestly, it's a technique 
he's not ready for yet.

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:16.800
But there was no way I could have 
stopped him from practicing...

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:33.990
The guy's obsessed with becoming 
stronger. Acting like a fool...

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:35.890
Okay!

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.300
<b>Begin!</b>

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:38.550
Are you ready?

00:07:38.860 --> 00:07:40.880
Yeah! Anytime...

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.390
Give me your best shot with 
this secret technique.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:46.270
<b>Begin!</b>

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:46.860
You never change, do you?

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:48.400
You'll regret it.

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.030
<b>Be...gin!</b>

00:07:50.200 --> 00:07:52.510
Why did you betray me back then?

00:07:56.450 --> 00:07:57.350
Don't play dumb.

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:00.700
Three years ago. At the end of 
our first year of middle school.

00:08:02.510 --> 00:08:04.290
Calm down, Baby Beel!

00:08:04.290 --> 00:08:07.650
I wanted to ask you, before I defeat you.

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.240
Transfer? Really?

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:14.220
When?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:18.800
Yeah... I'm going to my 
mother's house in the spring.

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:20.110
In Nara.

00:08:20.110 --> 00:08:22.420
Nara? Really?

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:23.970
That's really far away...

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:26.970
Oh, I know that place. With the Big Buddha!

00:08:26.970 --> 00:08:28.760
Why are you acting proud to know that?

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.700
Hey, don't just eat other people's food!

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:34.920
The two of us were in different classes,

00:08:35.590 --> 00:08:37.700
and it was only a few months 
we'd known each other...

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:40.790
But the time we spent 
together was really fun.

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:45.400
So I thought we'd continue to be 
friends, even if we moved apart.

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.960
Huh? What's yer problem?

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:55.050
Please give that charm back!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:56.170
You little punk!

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.020
Oh, this?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:02.720
Here... Oopsie, it slipped out of my hand...

00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:07.100
Oopsie, my foot slipped too...

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:08.390
Stop it!

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:10.420
You're makin' me sick, you wimp.

00:09:10.870 --> 00:09:12.730
Now play nice!

00:09:24.020 --> 00:09:24.660
Hey...

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:27.100
Are these guys your pals?

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:28.900
Oga?!

00:09:29.320 --> 00:09:31.320
It's the Rampaging Ogre from Kata Middle!

00:09:32.310 --> 00:09:35.490
I was thinking of helping to 
look for something you dropped,

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:37.510
You need help with that?

00:09:40.230 --> 00:09:42.970
No... I'll be fine by myself.

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:49.930
Give it back!

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.550
What's this? Are you trying to make me laugh?

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.530
Get your foot off my charm!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.670
So, you're Oga?

00:10:06.350 --> 00:10:09.010
Come on. You'll fall prey 
to this hand as well.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:11.660
Where are you looking?

00:10:12.310 --> 00:10:12.860
Huh?

00:10:14.960 --> 00:10:15.660
Why, you...

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:19.320
I told you to give it back!

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.180
Um...

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:40.720
I got that charm from my dad.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:46.120
My parents are divorced, see, and 
I'm going to live with my mother.

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:48.980
Oh, so that's why you're transferring.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:50.960
Anyway, is that wound okay?

00:10:52.130 --> 00:10:53.650
It's nothing much...

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:58.090
You got guts.

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:03.280
Weirdo...

00:11:05.270 --> 00:11:08.140
That's the first time I 
felt you accepted me...

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.690
But it was just my imagination...

00:11:15.650 --> 00:11:20.530
Did you hear? Oga-kun went and did a 
number on those guys from Mano Middle...

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:24.840
I heard! That Kiriya guy vowed 
revenge or something, right?

00:11:24.840 --> 00:11:26.790
He's as persistent as a snake!

00:11:28.890 --> 00:11:29.570
Oga-kun!

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:31.970
You're all beat up!

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:34.290
Why didn't you tell me?

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:38.050
It's my fault, right? So 
we should go together!

00:11:38.420 --> 00:11:41.820
So, yeah... Who are you, again?

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.410
Are you covering for me?

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:48.860
Pretending like we don't know each 
other, so I don't get involved?

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.210
It's okay! You don't have to do that!

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.890
I mean, I'm moving far away in a week anyway!

00:11:56.360 --> 00:11:57.890
So at least, until the end...

00:11:57.890 --> 00:11:58.710
Oga!

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:01.820
Get out here!

00:12:04.460 --> 00:12:06.010
So, you're Oga!

00:12:09.470 --> 00:12:11.170
Sure, I may get in your way, 
but whatever happens...

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:14.120
I... I...

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:15.910
I'm going to be together with you!

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:17.680
Wait, Oga-kun!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:32.430
You act like you know me.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:34.020
Who are you?

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:36.020
W-Why?

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:42.730
Get lost!

00:12:43.020 --> 00:12:45.720
You're a weakling! Get outta my sight!

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:20.480
<b>Annoyed... Annoyed... Annoyed...</b>

00:13:19.530 --> 00:13:22.640
You don't intend to say anything, do you?

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:24.630
Well, fine.

00:13:25.270 --> 00:13:26.610
To each his own, I suppose.

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:30.240
That's your answer.

00:13:34.250 --> 00:13:36.000
<b>Be...</b>

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:37.860
Here I come!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.160
<b>Begin!</b>

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:45.510
B-Baby Beel... You were 
close! So, don't cry...

00:13:51.480 --> 00:13:54.920
What's wrong? Weren't you going 
to show me your secret technique?

00:14:04.270 --> 00:14:07.140
Izuma Eight Spirits Style... 
Whirlwind Ax Kick!

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.250
That was close!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.720
Um, you took a direct hit.

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:20.280
Not even close!

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:22.910
A tiny tap like that don't phase me, asswipe!

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:26.090
Special Move Burying Kick!

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:27.680
Your feet...

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.660
Izuma Eight Spirits 
Style... Twin Palm Strike!

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:36.110
After that, I vowed...

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.920
...to become stronger, no matter what!

00:14:38.280 --> 00:14:41.800
I'd do anything no matter how hard...

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:45.420
Izuma Eight Spirits Style... Twin Bind Fist!

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:56.090
W-Whoa...

00:14:56.590 --> 00:14:58.200
Oga is actually being pushed back!

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:01.550
Miki really did get strong!

00:15:03.880 --> 00:15:05.040
I didn't feel it.

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.670
You really didn't think that 
was gonna end it, did you?

00:15:09.300 --> 00:15:15.600
Man, that Tojo person and all you 
delinquents are damn tough...

00:15:16.320 --> 00:15:19.290
Don't worry. The main event's about to start.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:23.830
I'm not gonna tell you to dodge it this time.

00:15:27.640 --> 00:15:28.590
Is this it?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.330
Izuma Eight Spirits Style...

00:15:39.310 --> 00:15:40.330
Secret Technique!

00:15:45.810 --> 00:15:47.310
Dark Death Warbler!

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:55.150
This technique is not yet perfected.

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.310
Currently about 70%...

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:04.440
Yeah, I held back some, but the main problem 
was that my hands were already injured.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.120
I can't use them again for a little while.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:12.910
It's harder than I thought to hit 
a person of flesh and blood...

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:16.620
Man... I can't really call this a victory.

00:16:17.230 --> 00:16:19.170
There're two weeks until the school festival.

00:16:19.900 --> 00:16:25.380
According to what Izuma told me, after the 
volleyball, there'll be a place for us to fight.

00:16:25.950 --> 00:16:29.100
Before then, I'm going to 
perfect this technique.

00:16:29.970 --> 00:16:36.360
And I'll show you once and for 
all that I'm stronger than you!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:49.690
Oga and Furuichi never came back, did they?

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:53.510
Seriously... Get 'em together 
and they split right back up.

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:55.870
We should deal with those idiots...

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:58.160
But, I wonder where they went?

00:16:58.540 --> 00:17:00.700
They left with their gym clothes on, right?

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.980
Maybe they fought with one 
of the 6 Holy Knights...

00:17:03.980 --> 00:17:06.360
Got the crap beat out of them...

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:11.330
Don't kid about that. I know they're 
stupid, but they aren't <i>that</i> stupid...

00:17:17.000 --> 00:17:18.360
They're all beat up.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:20.470
Hold it, you people!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:23.290
Don't tell me you actually got in a fight!

00:17:23.290 --> 00:17:24.270
Sorry...

00:17:24.770 --> 00:17:27.220
We'll make sure to come 
to practice tomorrow...

00:17:27.810 --> 00:17:29.640
Please forgive us for today!

00:17:29.640 --> 00:17:31.230
Wait, Oga!

00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.470
Oga!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:40.820
Miki's gotten crazy strong...

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:43.810
He must have worked super hard...

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:50.600
It's okay... There's no reason not to talk 
about what happened three years ago, right?

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:53.800
Why?!

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:58.430
It don't matter.

00:18:00.470 --> 00:18:01.300
Thank you!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:02.500
Sure, come again!

00:18:10.260 --> 00:18:10.730
Oga!

00:18:12.450 --> 00:18:14.540
How many jobs do you have?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:19.200
Now here's a rare customer... 
What'll I do you for?

00:18:20.890 --> 00:18:21.970
Let's fight.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:27.030
That's a pricey one...

00:18:32.850 --> 00:18:36.430
Oh, yeah... The first time 
we fought was around here...

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:38.720
So, what happened?

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:43.240
You were fine and dandy after 
taking that shrimp's attack...

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.270
Why, you...

00:18:45.570 --> 00:18:46.650
Crushing Fist!

00:18:48.770 --> 00:18:50.270
That hurt.

00:18:52.410 --> 00:18:54.360
Wait, you're kidding me...

00:18:55.090 --> 00:18:57.360
Did that shrimp give you those wounds?

00:18:58.130 --> 00:18:59.740
O-Of course not, jerk!

00:19:00.500 --> 00:19:02.950
These came from... You know, a toothache!

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:05.080
Really?

00:19:05.670 --> 00:19:06.670
Yeah, really.

00:19:07.050 --> 00:19:08.170
I see.

00:19:08.690 --> 00:19:10.120
I said it was a toothache!

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:14.630
Well, no choice then!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:28.040
Hey, whoa...

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:35.020
I'll give you another 2 or 3 cavities!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:41.820
If I got a special move good 
enough to take you down...

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:46.440
I can beat that guy!

00:19:47.810 --> 00:19:48.710
Huh?

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.160
It didn't hurt at all.

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:54.010
Did you get weaker?

00:19:55.580 --> 00:19:58.320
Who gives a crap about 
special moves or whatever...

00:19:58.710 --> 00:20:00.820
All that matters is how 
strong a guy's arm is!

00:20:13.050 --> 00:20:13.730
Oga!

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:22.620
Looks like yours ain't hurtin' either...

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:24.660
Liar.

00:20:43.290 --> 00:20:46.080
I'm not made for their world...

00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:48.430
They're laughing while 
punching each other out...

00:20:56.680 --> 00:20:58.160
Wait, Beel!

00:20:58.680 --> 00:20:59.860
Don't call it!

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:04.690
Just look! Oga's clearly way more beat up!

00:21:06.770 --> 00:21:07.990
You came close...

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.560
Don't pretend like you've won!

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.620
Let's go, Baby Beel.

00:21:17.220 --> 00:21:18.960
Sorry for worrying you...

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:20.640
But I can see clearly now.

00:21:22.070 --> 00:21:23.970
My ultimate special move...

00:21:28.980 --> 00:21:31.880
Well, have a look. Basically, 
it's about fighting spirit.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:37.500
Next time I'll beat that shrimp 
'til he's on his knees...

00:21:38.610 --> 00:21:41.880
Volleyball, fighting... I'll win them all!

00:23:28.810 --> 00:23:31.300
Sorry about always asking 
you for this, Oshizu-san...

00:23:32.920 --> 00:23:34.590
Ooh, that's the spot.

00:23:34.590 --> 00:23:37.740
You're too tense. Go to a real chiropractor!

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:46.110
Aren't you jealous?

00:23:46.110 --> 00:23:47.990
I mean, isn't that hot?

00:23:47.990 --> 00:23:50.030
What do you think, everyone?

00:24:02.270 --> 00:24:04.220
It's finally the school festival 
everyone's been waiting for!

00:24:04.220 --> 00:24:06.120
It's time to finish things 
with the 6 Holy Knights!

00:24:06.120 --> 00:24:09.250
But before that, there's 
something we must do.

00:24:09.250 --> 00:24:12.920
Strategist, please help 
us with our class's café!

00:24:12.920 --> 00:24:13.870
Leave it to me!

00:24:13.870 --> 00:24:18.680
For this day, I gathered data in Akihabara 
and have taken pictures together with the maids!

00:24:18.680 --> 00:24:20.310
A maid café?!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:23.520
On the next Beelzebub: Maids Run Amok.

00:24:23.520 --> 00:24:26.390
Now then, about next week, Azusa-kun...

00:24:26.390 --> 00:24:27.800
Come again! (We've got maids!)
